We have Allowed and disabled field in policy setting. How are we planning to support this?. Also these values can be set.

```
SPDM {
  Allowed {
    Versions [ ]
  },
  Denied {
    Versions [ ]
}
}

```

https://www.dmtf.org/sites/default/files/standards/documents/DSP2046_2025.1.pdf

Or by using None, we are not going to support those policy settings?
